# SheCare Frontend - Environment Variables

# ⚠️ CRITICAL: Must be exact path to backend API
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost/api

# App Configuration
VITE_APP_NAME=SheCare
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0

# Note: After changing this file, you MUST restart the dev server
# 1. Stop: Ctrl+C
# 2. Start: npm run dev
# 2. Start: npm run dev